#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Hiện tại nó chỉ đang hiển thị huy hiệu của trường.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにある毒薬を飲んで…
#. 大神さんは自らの命を絶ったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sakura ended her life...by drinking the poison she got\n"
"from here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう仕向けたのは黒幕だ！
#. だから、黒幕を許しちゃいけない！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's all the mastermind's fault! Whoever they are, I\n"
"can never forgive them!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにある毒薬を飲んで…
#. 大神さんは自らの命を絶ったんだ…
